    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2019_0564","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Zofia Nakamura talks about the long argument with the colour blue. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
